· Swoole<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">注解路由 \/ 依赖注入 \/ 协程<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\"><\/td><\/tr><tr><th>前端<\/th><td><b>Vue 3.5 · Naive UI 2.45<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">浏览器原生 ESM + import map<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\"><\/td><\/tr><tr><th>构建<\/th><td><b>无<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">零构建：没有 node_modules、没有打包<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\"><\/td><\/tr><tr><th>存储<\/th><td><b>MySQL<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">手写分页，不依赖 ORM 分页器<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\"><\/td><\/tr><tr><th>认证<\/th><td><b>HMAC 签名 Cookie<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">无会话（不装 hyperf\/session）<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\"><\/td><\/tr><tr><th>测试<\/th><td><b>136 项 · 4 层<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">payload \/ wiring \/ 前端 \/ SSR<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\"><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/section><\/div><div class=\"ea-dash__col\"><section class=\"ea-dash__section\"><h3>特点<\/h3><table class=\"ea-dash__table\"><tbody><tr><th>响应跟手<\/th><td><b>切换不闪屏<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">点菜单 \/ 翻页只换取几 KB JSON，页面骨架常驻，不重载整页；服务端 5~6 ms，点击后几乎无等待。首屏是一次性资源下载（gzip 后约 660 KB）<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\"><\/td><\/tr><tr><th>零构建<\/th><td><b>改一行 JS 直接生效<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">不需要 npm \/ 打包 \/ 等编译，宿主项目不用引入前端工具链<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\"><\/td><\/tr><tr><th>装得进别人的项目<\/th><td><b>不动宿主配置<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">routes.php \/ middlewares.php \/ translation 都不用改，composer require + 一行 Provider<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\"><\/td><\/tr><tr><th>Builder API<\/th><td><b>四种页面 · 8 行 CRUD<\/b><br><span class=\"ea-dash__muted\">列表 \/ 表单 \/ 详情 \/ 内容；带筛选、排序、导出、批量删除、行操作弹层<\/span><\/td><td class=\"ea-dash__state ea-dash__state--blank\